# Both abilities are on the stack when Bot2 exiles the attacking Preacher with Swords to Plowshares (Bot1 gains 2, to 22).
# The triggers do not depend on their source (CR 113.7a): the Vampire is made and Bot1 draws a card and loses 1 life
# (22 - 1 = 21). No combat damage reaches Bot2 (the Preacher is gone), so it stays at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Preacher of the Schism
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
10 Swamp

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
10 Swamp

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Preacher of the Schism.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Preacher of the Schism > Bot2)
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Preacher of the Schism)
? Stack.Count = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Life = 21
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Vampire Token.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Preacher of the Schism = (absent)
Exile = Preacher of the Schism
